sequenceDiagram
  actor PI as Researcher
  actor Chair as School Chair / Dean
  actor Sec as School Secretary
  participant Q as chair-review.html
  participant SS as SchoolReviewService
  participant D as secretary-home.html
  PI->>SS: Submit proposal
  SS-->>Q: appears in school queue (own school only)
  Chair->>Q: Open queue, view documents
  alt Endorse (Pass)
    Chair->>Q: Click "รับรอง → ส่งส่วนบริหาร"
    Q->>SS: endorse(id)
    SS-->>PI: notified, proposal goes to central screening
  else Return for revision
    Chair->>Q: Click "ส่งกลับแก้ไข" + reason
    Q->>SS: returnToPI(id, reason)
    SS-->>PI: notified to revise
    PI->>SS: Resubmit
    SS-->>Q: goes straight back to Chair queue
  end
  Sec->>D: Open dashboard
  D->>SS: list proposals of own school
  SS-->>D: documents, statuses, reviewer comments (real time)
